---
title: Data lifecycle — from a provider call to a spoken bar
---
%% Verified against the tree on 2026-08-28.
%% The DataState machine has SIX states, not five: Stalled sits between LiveStreaming
%% and Faulted and is what the LiveStreamManager watchdog trips into.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant MO as MarketOrchestrator
    participant DO as DataOrchestrator<br/>(Polly retry + breaker)
    participant HDF as HistoricalDataFetcher
    participant P as Provider plugin<br/>(IMarketDataProvider)
    participant OS as OhlcvStore<br/>(cache + dedup)
    participant RS as ResamplerService
    participant DM as DataManager
    participant ST as WorkspaceStore
    participant IO as IndicatorOrchestrator
    participant AFC as AccessibilityFeedbackCoordinator
    participant SMM as SonificationManager
    participant CR as ChartRenderer

    Note over U,MO: Load — market to provider to symbol to timeframe
    U->>MO: choose market / provider / symbol
    MO->>DO: LoadChartAsync
    Note over DO: DataState: Initializing to HistoricalFilling

    DO->>HDF: fetch the requested window
    HDF->>OS: what do we already hold?
    OS-->>HDF: cached bars + the gaps
    HDF->>P: FetchOhlcvAsync(symbol, timeframe, since, until)
    P-->>HDF: Ohlcv[] (venue symbol shaped, timestamps normalised to UTC)
    HDF->>OS: persist — insert and CORRECT, never insert-only
    OS->>RS: build any timeframe the venue does not serve natively
    RS-->>DM: bars
    DM->>ST: SetData

    Note over DO: DataState: GapFilling to LiveStreaming
    ST-->>IO: StateStream — InitStatus Ready
    IO->>IO: recompute every active indicator, profile, heatmap
    IO->>ST: SetIndicatorData
    ST-->>CR: repaint (native canvas or PNG over SignalR, ~10 fps)

    Note over P,DO: Live — websocket ticks
    loop while streaming
        P-->>DO: tick
        DO->>DM: update the forming bar / append a closed one
        DM->>ST: UpdateData
        par indicators
            ST-->>IO: recompute the tail only
            IO->>ST: SetIndicatorData
        and feedback
            ST-->>AFC: state change
            AFC-->>SMM: re-sync navigation voices
        end
    end

    Note over DO: Watchdog — no tick inside the expected bar interval
    DO->>DO: DataState: LiveStreaming to Stalled
    DO->>P: reconnect, then backfill the bars missed mid-bar
    alt reconnect succeeds
        DO->>DO: Stalled to GapFilling to LiveStreaming
    else keeps failing — breaker opens
        DO->>DO: Stalled to Faulted
        DO->>AFC: announce it — a silent failure is invisible to this user
    end

    Note over U,SMM: Navigation — the user moves, and only then is anything said
    U->>ST: arrow key to another bar
    ST-->>AFC: navigation change
    AFC->>AFC: SpeechFeedbackRouter formats the phrase
    AFC-->>U: speech (screen reader / Orca / browser TTS)
    ST-->>SMM: SyncNavigationSlots
    SMM-->>U: sonification (pitch = value, pan = position in viewport)
